warning[W09015]: unnecessary import for method syntax
   ┌─ tests/move_2024/typing/dot_call_alias_unnecessary.move:14:21
   │
14 │     use a::m::{new, consume, borrow};
   │                     ^^^^^^^ Unnecessary 'use' of alias 'consume'. It is only used with method syntax (dot notation), which does not require this import
   │
   = This warning can be suppressed with '#[allow(unused_dot_call_alias)]' applied to the 'module' or module member ('const', 'fun', or 'struct')

